1
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:19,400
I'm freezing! I'm definitely
gonna wear a scarf tomorrow.

2
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:23,150
It gets pretty cold in the evenings now, huh.

3
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:30,520
Y-Yo.

4
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:34,850
Hey.

5
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:42,060
Hey, you! Don't you go
stealing <i>my</i> Miyamura, Tanihara!

6
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:44,600
I-I'm not stealing him from you, jeez!

7
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:48,230
You guys are so weird! You're always
cuddling with each other and stuff!

8
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:52,310
S-Sorry, but that's all it is!

9
00:00:52,310 --> 00:00:55,730
We've kinda gotten close lately, that's it!

10
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:58,940
The hell do you mean, you've gotten close?

11
00:00:58,940 --> 00:01:01,690
Closer than <i>just friends</i> ?

12
00:01:01,690 --> 00:01:04,400
Oh, please. I'm not Shindo.

13
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,940
Dude!

14
00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:10,270
W-Wait, really? Is that
what Shindo- <i>kun</i> is to you?

15
00:01:06,790 --> 00:01:09,920
Creak...

16
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:11,920
Trembling

17
00:01:10,270 --> 00:01:12,100
Absolutely not!

18
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:15,600
C'mon, Tanihara, spill the damn beans!

19
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:23,770
I mean, I saw Shindo go over to
Miyamura's to get a change of clothes once.

20
00:01:23,770 --> 00:01:27,560
Look, he stays over at my place a lot!
Even when I don't want him to!

21
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:34,770
A wild Shindo appears!

22
00:01:34,770 --> 00:01:40,060
Why're you guys blockin' the
sidewalk? What's goin' on, huh?

23
00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:43,730
Shindo- <i>kun</i> , are you close with Chika- <i>chan</i> ?

24
00:01:43,730 --> 00:01:47,560
Kinda? Though lately,
she's been busy studying for exams,

25
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:49,440
so we haven't hung out much.

26
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:53,770
Though I've spent plenty
of nights at Miyamura's!

27
00:01:51,130 --> 00:01:53,340
* Playing video games

28
00:01:55,730 --> 00:01:58,400
Hey, Shindo, let's go get some Mickey D's!

29
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:02,400
Can't spell "burger"
without Shindo, am I right?!

30
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:06,440
Wait, what? Makes no sense, but okay.

31
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:08,190
Is that free coffee coupon still good?

32
00:02:08,190 --> 00:02:10,350
No, it expired.

33
00:02:10,350 --> 00:02:13,600
Miyamura, I just want you
to know something, okay?

34
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:16,730
I'm not worried about <i>girls</i> .

35
00:02:16,730 --> 00:02:23,230
But when I think about
some <i>guy</i> taking you, I can't...

36
00:02:23,230 --> 00:02:25,060
Taking me <i>how</i> ?!

37
00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:29,650
Promise me this! If you fall for
someone else, it better be a girl!

38
00:02:29,650 --> 00:02:32,190
No guys, okay?!

39
00:02:32,190 --> 00:02:34,600
O-Okay!

40
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:36,900
So I had to promise her "no guys" yesterday.

41
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:40,230
You guys need to stay away from me, okay?!

42
00:02:40,230 --> 00:02:43,980
Sure, but... what about when
you need to use the bathroom?

43
00:02:43,980 --> 00:02:46,400
I just won't go!

44
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:49,100
Good luck with that, bro.

45
00:03:00,610 --> 00:03:12,790
Horimiya

46
00:04:19,770 --> 00:04:22,600
Man, this is my day off!

47
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:26,150
You could've gone shopping
for art supplies by yourself!

48
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:35,040
Until the Snow Melts

49
00:04:26,150 --> 00:04:31,100
I want to hit up the bookstore, too.
I can't carry everything by myself.

50
00:04:31,100 --> 00:04:34,980
Or you could just go to
the bookstore another day.

51
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:38,150
Is that you, Yoshikawa- <i>san</i> ?

52
00:04:38,150 --> 00:04:41,400
Yanagi- <i>kun</i> ? Whoa, you're wearing glasses!

53
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:44,940
I thought it was you. What're you shopping for?

54
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:48,730
Oh, books and stuff, but mostly art supplies.

55
00:04:48,730 --> 00:04:51,810
Art supplies? I didn't know you
were an artist, Yoshikawa- <i>san</i> .

56
00:04:51,810 --> 00:04:55,600
Oh, they're not for me, they're for my sister...

57
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:58,060
"Stare"

58
00:04:58,690 --> 00:05:00,270
This is my older sister.

59
00:05:00,270 --> 00:05:03,230
Pleased to meet you, I'm Akane Yanagi.

60
00:05:03,230 --> 00:05:08,270
Likewise. Didn't know Yuki was
friends with a hottie like you.

61
00:05:08,270 --> 00:05:10,190
Unless you're her <i>boyfriend</i> ?

62
00:05:10,190 --> 00:05:13,150
No, ma'am. She turned me down.

63
00:05:13,150 --> 00:05:16,270
I figured. You wouldn't date--

64
00:05:16,270 --> 00:05:18,810
Wait, she turned you down?!
Not the other way around?!

65
00:05:18,810 --> 00:05:20,560
Oh, my God, shut up!

66
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:23,350
Wait, hold on...

67
00:05:23,350 --> 00:05:27,060
No, I'm far out of her league.

68
00:05:27,060 --> 00:05:29,560
Wait, Yuki's league? <i>This</i> Yuki?

