218
00:06:57,270 --> 00:07:02,600
Why couldn't I just tell her the truth?
What's wrong with me?

219
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:07,730
Did you want to talk to me
to see if I'd tell her the truth?

220
00:07:07,730 --> 00:07:09,150
Yeah.

221
00:07:09,150 --> 00:07:14,770
I'll stay quiet about it if you admit
that you have a crush on Ishikawa- <i>kun</i> .

222
00:07:14,770 --> 00:07:16,940
That's not fair.

223
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:19,310
What's not fair about it?

224
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:25,230
You're the one being unfair, don't you think?

225
00:07:27,020 --> 00:07:31,600
